        <briefdescription>
<para>Supply a topology snapshot for TOPOLOGY_AWARE scheduling. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When the TOPOLOGY_AWARE strategy is active the balancer picks the device with the highest sum of outgoing NVLink bandwidths according to the provided topology&apos;s bandwidth_matrix. If the topology has no NVLink links (or no topology has been set) the strategy falls back to LEAST_LOADED behaviour.</para>
<para>Thread safety: acquires the internal mutex.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>topology</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Topology snapshot produced by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_cluster_topology_1a7f1f3e495373b01d6729f123861d9e63" kindref="member">GPUClusterTopology::detect()</ref> or assembled manually for testing. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
